  <releases>
    <release version="0.2.0" date="2026-11-08">
      <url type="details">https://github.com/othman2408/forti-vpn/releases/tag/v0.2.0</url>
      <description>
        <p>Rust rewrite for all major Linux distributions.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Packages for Debian and Ubuntu, Fedora, RHEL-compatible systems, openSUSE, and Arch Linux</li>
          <li>Setup guidance for each distribution's FortiClient package and tray support</li>
          <li>A tray icon that shows whether the VPN is connected</li>
          <li>Connect uses the password FortiClient has saved for a profile; Update Saved Password changes it</li>
          <li>When FortiClient's service is stopped, the app says so and shows the command to start it</li>
          <li>Preferences from version 0.1.0 are kept</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="0.1.0" date="2026-10-02">
      <url type="details">https://github.com/othman2408/forti-vpn/releases/tag/v0.1.0</url>
